<title>USA: Shop at Home sees Jan revs of $6.6 million.</title>
<headline>Shop at Home sees Jan revs of $6.6 million.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shop at Home Inc said it expects to report that its revenues in January will reach $6.6 million, compared with $3.3 million for the same month last year.</p>
<p>Shop at Home said the January increase represents the company's first 100 percent growth month and puts it on track for a revenue increase for the quarter ending March 31.</p>
<p>The company made no revenue or earnings projections for the quarter, however.</p>
<p>Officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
